  "description": "The engine of OfficeAgent.NET, built on the Open XML SDK: lets an AI agent or a .NET application edit existing Word, PowerPoint and Excel files and fill company templates while keeping their formatting, numbering and comments. Find text against live content, preview a typed edit plan, and commit it atomically; a change that fails validation writes nothing. Includes folder and in-memory storage. Add a format module such as OfficeAgent.Word.",
